  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "description": "Explains what this dashboard or section shows.",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Answers:** how much cost (US dollars) the harness attributed to LLM calls and tool calls, over time and by provider, model and workflow.\n\n**Data comes from:** LLM calls on priced providers (`anthropic`, `openai`, and `ollama` at a rate of zero) and tool calls. The harness writes cost as text in `cost.attributed_decimal`; the kit's collector copies it into the number `cost.attributed_number`, which these panels sum. Rates come from the harness rate table, whose defaults are placeholders for the operator to override.\n\nThe stack keeps traces for 24 hours, so no panel can look further back than that."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Subscription CLI routes show no cost",
      "description": "Why do subscription CLI calls show no cost?",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Subscription CLI routes are never priced, by design.** Calls through `claude_code`, `codex`, `gemini` and `antigravity` have no rate-table row: their usage is kept as evidence (`external_cli.usage.*`) and no cost attribute is written. They therefore add nothing to any panel here. This is expected and does not mean the calls were free of charge under your subscription.\n\nLocal Ollama calls are priced at a rate of zero, so they appear with a cost of 0."
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Attributed cost",
      "description": "How much cost was attributed in the selected time range?",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.namespace =~ \"$namespace\" && span.cost.attributed_number != nil } | sum_over_time(span.cost.attributed_number)",
          "filters": [],
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
